{"format":1,"key":"zone:blackfathom","path":"/lore/zone/blackfathom","name":"Blackfathom Deeps","kind":"dungeon","label":"Dungeon","zone":{"key":"blackfathom","name":"Blackfathom Deeps","path":"/lore/zone/blackfathom"},"levels":"Levels 24-32","description":"Blackfathom Deeps is a flooded subterranean temple complex situated along the Zoram Strand in northwestern Ashenvale. Once a shrine dedicated to the…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:blackfathom","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["Blackfathom Deeps is a flooded subterranean temple complex situated along the Zoram Strand in northwestern Ashenvale. Once a shrine dedicated to the night elven moon goddess Elune, the sunken sanctuary has been overtaken by the Twilight's Hammer cult, treacherous naga, and satyrs. They gather in its dark waters to venerate and nurture Aku'mai, a primordial pet and herald of the Old Gods.","Long before the Great Sundering shattered ancient Kalimdor, this complex was known as Lathar'Lazal, a splendid temple dedicated to Elune. Highborne masons raised gem-encrusted bridges while Queen Azshara commanded the surrounding waters, partitionining salt seas and mountain streams around a sacred moonwell. When the Sundering tore the world apart ten thousand years ago, the temple sank into the coastal depths of the Veiled Sea. For millenia, it sat undisturbed beneath the waves—until foul whispers began seeping upward from the subterranean dark."],"hash":"241f6a","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"fd709e7bdb","sec":59},"female-narrator":{"sha":"ba94c5c4d6","sec":62}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Blackfathom Deeps (Classic)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Blackfathom_Deeps_(Classic)"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"Blackfathom Deeps","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Blackfathom_Deeps"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/npc/aku-mai","n":"Aku'mai","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/twilight-lord-kelris","n":"Twilight Lord Kelris","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/lady-sarevess","n":"Lady Sarevess","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1200-blackfathom-villainy","n":"Blackfathom Villainy","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1199-twilight-falls","n":"Twilight Falls","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/824-jeneu-of-the-earthen-ring","n":"Je'neu of the Earthen Ring","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/zoram-strand","n":"Zoram Strand","k":"subzone"}],"children":[{"p":"/lore/subzone/moonshrine-ruins","n":"Moonshrine Ruins","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/pool-of-ask-ar","n":"Pool of Ask'ar","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/npc/aku-mai","n":"Aku'mai","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/baron-aquanis","n":"Baron Aquanis","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/gelihast","n":"Gelihast","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/ghamoo-ra-classic","n":"Ghamoo-ra","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/je-neu-sancrea","n":"Je'neu Sancrea","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/lady-sarevess","n":"Lady Sarevess","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/lorgus-jett","n":"Lorgus Jett","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/old-serra-kis","n":"Old Serra'kis","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/twilight-lord-kelris","n":"Twilight Lord Kelris","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/quest/6565-allegiance-to-the-old-gods","n":"Allegiance to the Old Gods","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/6921-amongst-the-ruins","n":"Amongst the Ruins","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/6922-baron-aquanis","n":"Baron Aquanis","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1200-blackfathom-villainy","n":"Blackfathom Villainy","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/6561-blackfathom-villainy","n":"Blackfathom Villainy","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1198-in-search-of-thaelrid","n":"In Search of Thaelrid","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/824-jeneu-of-the-earthen-ring","n":"Je'neu of the Earthen Ring","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/971-knowledge-in-the-deeps","n":"Knowledge in the Deeps","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1275-researching-the-corruption","n":"Researching the Corruption","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/6563-the-essence-of-akumai","n":"The Essence of Aku'Mai","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/6562-trouble-in-the-deeps","n":"Trouble in the